+ * plan 138: map_fd from NeXTMach https://github.com/johnsonjh/NeXTMach.git
+ * f6bdb9c3268f0eadc545d41bcc0564453b17001e mk-108.1/kern/syscall_subr.c:165,170,620-741
+ * (the original kernel has _map_fd at the end of this object).  NeXTMach notice:
